// expect: ok
// #159 (dkhlapov): `--say x "text x.v <value>" "emit x"` in a burst: the logic (say-burst.luau) has to read
// the text of its own call at each `x`, and hear each one with `on("text:x.v")`, in order.
// And `"fact x.n <n>" "emit x"`: each `x` reads the fact of its own call (0.12; before, the `emit` overtook it).
scene X {
    surface { size: 200, 100 }
    text x.v = ""
    fact x.n = 0
    text facts = ""
    text out = ""
    text heard = ""
    event x ->
}
